<title>USA: NY pension fund picks Oppenheimer Capital.</title>
<headline>NY pension fund picks Oppenheimer Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York State Comptroller H. Carl McCall said on Friday that the state's common retirement fund selected Oppenheimer Capital LP to run a mid cap value portfolio.</p>
<p>Funding is expected to be $200 million and contract talks are still in progress, McCall said in a statement.</p>
